            "journey_featured_name": "天冷就要吃鍋！板南線老饕必吃火鍋！",
            "featured_main_photo": "/src/assets/images/featured/pic-featured_blue_hotpot_main.svg",
            "featured_photos": [
              "/src/assets/images/featured/pic-featured_blue_hotpot_1.svg",
